    "summary_short": "Overwhelmed by years of physical and mental exhaustion, a veteran paramedic counts down the final hours of his career. His last 24-hour shift becomes unexpectedly complicated when he is tasked with training a wide-eyed new recruit. As high-stress emergency calls roll in across the city, the unlikely duo must navigate intense life-or-death situations and absurd urban encounters. Together, they form an unexpected bond that challenges the veteran's cynicism and prepares the rookie for the harsh realities of emergency medical service.",
    "summary_long": "After years of enduring relentless physical strain and emotional trauma on the frontlines of emergency response, a veteran paramedic prepares to leave the profession forever. However, his quiet departure is upended when his chief assigns him a fresh-faced rookie to train during his final 24-hour shift. The shift quickly turns into a trial by fire as the pair is thrust into a nonstop series of high-stakes medical emergencies, volatile street scenarios, and bizarre calls. As the hours tick away, the veteran struggle to maintain his detachment while managing his trainee's idealism and inevitable mistakes. Navigating the chaotic city streets, the rookie forces the burnt-out mentor to confront the hidden personal cost of his years of service and the reasons he started in the first place. Through shared adrenaline, sharp humor, and life-and-death stakes, the veteran passes on critical survival lessons while learning a bit about grace and second chances. By the time the sunrise signals the end of the shift, both first responders are permanently changed by the crucible of their shared day.",
